flowchart LR
    classDef user fill:#FFE082,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef app fill:#C8E6C9,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef db fill:#B3E5FC,stroke:#333,color:#000

    U[User Action]:::user -->|POST /commands| API[Command API]:::app
    API --> CH[Command Handler]:::app
    CH --> AGG["Aggregate<br/>domain rules"]:::app

    subgraph TX["Single Postgres Transaction"]
        EV[(events table)]:::db
        ST[(aggregate state)]:::db
        Q1[(PGMQ proj_ui)]:::db
        Q2[(PGMQ proj_graph)]:::db
        Q3[(PGMQ proj_analytics)]:::db
    end

    AGG -->|append event| EV
    AGG -->|upsert state| ST
    AGG -->|enqueue| Q1
    AGG -->|enqueue| Q2
    AGG -->|enqueue| Q3

    Q1 -->|poll| P1[UI Projector]:::app
    Q2 -->|poll| P2[Graph Projector]:::app
    Q3 -->|poll| P3[Analytics Projector]:::app

    P1 --> RM1[(ui tables)]:::db
    P2 --> RM2[(AGE graph)]:::db
    P3 --> RM3[(TimescaleDB)]:::db

    RM1 -.->|GET /queries| API
    RM2 -.->|GET /queries| API
    RM3 -.->|GET /queries| API
